    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5869" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίκειμαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lie round</i> or
				<i>upon,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				92
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ἀλλήλοισιν ἀμφικείμενοι</span>
			<i>locked in</i> each other's <i>arms,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
