				<u>OC</u>
				1620
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ὀλέθρῳ . . ἀμφικεῖσθαι
				μόρον</span> slaughter <i>is heaped on</i> slaughter,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1292
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
